<p>A surge of twilight pulses from you, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">30, 57, 77, 95, 110</acronym> light and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">30, 57, 77, 95, 110</acronym> darkness damage to all others within radius 5.</p><p>The damage dealt will increase with your Spellpower.</p>